{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_002_native_groovy_composer_tasks_golden_file_capture", "label": "T001: golden file capture (eda-golden temporary copy + SHA-256)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/002-native-groovy-composer/tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_002_native_groovy_composer_tasks_t014_byte_equivalence_caveat", "label": "T014: byte-equivalence caveat (committed file is not the target)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/002-native-groovy-composer/tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The committed monolith had been manually edited after the bash era (properties?.show_archetype_post_generate_log used directly, without the intermediate variable), so byte-equivalence with the committed file is NOT the goal \u2014 the composer generates the bash-equivalent version, and that equivalence held."}, {"id": "specs_002_native_groovy_composer_tasks_t019_gmaven_classpath_finding", "label": "T019 finding: gmaven 2.1.1 ignores the dependency override", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/002-native-groovy-composer/tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "gmaven:2.1.1 runs in its own classloader and mvn dependency:tree does not show plugin dependencies; the Groovy 4.0.28 override is not applied, but the composer works with the default Groovy 2.4.9 \u2014 sufficient, so no exclusion chase was needed."}, {"id": "specs_002_native_groovy_composer_tasks_sections_implementation", "label": "T007-T011: composer implementation (SECTIONS, imports, prepend, write)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/002-native-groovy-composer/tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_002_nat